1
00:00:02,089 --> 00:00:05,325
Rukiye! Shutter mat giraiye... please!

2
00:00:06,241 --> 00:00:08,994
Bachche ka syrup... doctor ne likha hai.

3
00:00:09,958 --> 00:00:12,083
Yeh toh... khatam hai.

4
00:00:13,506 --> 00:00:15,090
Hamesha toh yahin milta tha.

5
00:00:15,944 --> 00:00:17,731
Mummy, ab kahan jaayenge?

6
00:00:18,694 --> 00:00:22,071
Maaf kijiye... kal tak mangwa doongi!

7
00:00:26,401 --> 00:00:27,715
Raat bhar soyi nahi?

8
00:00:28,092 --> 00:00:29,926
