13
00:00:49,358 --> 00:00:50,863
Didi... aaya?

14
00:00:51,225 --> 00:00:52,902
Aapke liye alag rakha tha.

15
00:00:53,222 --> 00:00:54,232
Aapko yaad tha!

16
00:00:55,076 --> 00:00:56,633
Thank you, aunty!

17
00:00:58,517 --> 00:01:02,963
Stock khatam hone se pehle alert. Nexcod POS.
